      "id": "loc_wreck_cradle",
      "name": "Wreck Cradle",
      "description": "An open truss berth for condemned ships, reached by slow tug from the yard. One supposedly scrapped hull remains here, its furled sail showing a faint, regular power draw that should have ended when its registry was closed."
